<title>CANADA: CANADA DOLLAR STRENGTHENS ON CENTRAL BANK COMMENTS.</title>
<headline>CANADA DOLLAR STRENGTHENS ON CENTRAL BANK COMMENTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3935/1.3975	   ASIAN CLOSE     1.3935</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3855   SUPPORT 1.3405     HI 1.3957   LO  1.3930</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3951/56   HI 1.3956     EUROPE OPEN     1.3938</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3930/35   LO 1.3919     HI 1.3948   LO  1.3926</p>
<p>----------------------MARKET COMMENT-------------------------</p>
<p>* The Canadian dollar strengthened slightly to C$1.3927 (US$0.7180) in steady midday trading on Tuesday after the Bank of Canada summer review painted a positive picture for Canada's economy and predicted a stronger Canadian dollar, traders said. * The central bank also said less stimulative monetary conditions would be needed to preserve non-inflationary economic growth.</p>
